\s1 The Proclamation of Cyrus
\p \v 1 \rb In the first|אַחַ֗ת\rb* \rb year|וּבִשְׁנַ֣ת\rb* \rb of Cyrus|לְכ֙וֹרֶשׁ֙\rb* \rb king|מֶ֣לֶךְ\rb* \rb of Persia|פָּרַ֔ס\rb*, \rb to fulfill|לִכְל֥וֹת\rb* \rb the word|דְּבַר־\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb spoken|מִפִּ֣י\rb* \rb through Jeremiah|יִרְמְיָ֑ה\rb*, \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֗ה\rb* \rb stirred|הֵעִ֣יר\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the spirit|ר֙וּחַ֙\rb* \rb of Cyrus|כֹּ֣רֶשׁ\rb* \rb king|מֶֽלֶךְ־\rb* \rb of Persia|פָּרַ֔ס\rb* \rb to send|וַיַּֽעֲבֶר־\rb* \rb a proclamation|קוֹל֙\rb* \rb throughout|בְּכָל־\rb* \rb his kingdom|מַלְכוּת֔וֹ\rb* \rb and|וְגַם־\rb* \rb to put it in writing|בְּמִכְתָּ֖ב\rb* \rb as follows|לֵאמֹֽר׃\rb*:
\p \v 2 “\rb This is what|כֹּ֣ה\rb* \rb Cyrus|כֹּ֚רֶשׁ\rb* \rb king|מֶ֣לֶךְ\rb* \rb of Persia|פָּרַ֔ס\rb* \rb says|אָמַ֗ר\rb*:
\p ‘\rb The LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb*, \rb the God|אֱלֹהֵ֣י\rb* \rb of heaven|הַשָּׁמָ֑יִם\rb*, \rb who|וְהֽוּא־\rb* \rb has given|נָ֣תַן\rb* \rb me|לִ֔י\rb* \rb all|כֹּ֚ל\rb* \rb the kingdoms|מַמְלְכ֣וֹת\rb* \rb of the earth|הָאָ֔רֶץ\rb*, \rb has appointed|פָקַ֤ד\rb* \rb me|עָלַי֙\rb* \rb to build|לִבְנֽוֹת־\rb* \rb a house|בַ֔יִת\rb* \rb for Him|ל֣וֹ\rb* \rb at Jerusalem|בִּירוּשָׁלִַ֖ם\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb in Judah|בִּֽיהוּדָֽה׃\rb*.
\p \v 3 \rb Whoever|מִֽי־\rb* \rb among you|בָכֶ֣ם\rb* \rb belongs to|מִכָּל־\rb* \rb His people|עַמּ֗וֹ\rb*, \rb may his God|אֱלֹהָיו֙\rb* \rb be|יְהִ֤י\rb* \rb with him|עִמּ֔וֹ\rb*, \rb and may he go|וְיַ֕עַל\rb* \rb to Jerusalem|לִירוּשָׁלִַ֖ם\rb* \rb in Judah|בִּיהוּדָ֑ה\rb* \rb and build|וְיִ֗בֶן\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the house|בֵּ֤ית\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָה֙\rb*, \rb the God|אֱלֹהֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Israel|יִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb*; \rb He is|ה֥וּא\rb* \rb the God|הָאֱלֹהִ֖ים\rb* \rb who|אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb is in Jerusalem|בִּירוּשָׁלִָֽם׃\rb*. \v 4 \rb And let every|וְכָל־\rb* \rb survivor|הַנִּשְׁאָ֗ר\rb*, \rb wherever|מִֽכָּל־\rb*\rb |הַמְּקֹמוֹת֮\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb he|ה֣וּא\rb* \rb lives|גָֽר־\rb*,\rb |שָׁם֒\rb* \rb be assisted|יְנַשְּׂא֙וּהוּ֙\rb* \rb by the men|אַנְשֵׁ֣י\rb* \rb of that region|מְקֹמ֔וֹ\rb* \rb with silver|בְּכֶ֥סֶף\rb*, \rb gold|וּבְזָהָ֖ב\rb*, \rb goods|וּבִרְכ֣וּשׁ\rb*, \rb and livestock|וּבִבְהֵמָ֑ה\rb*, \rb along with|עִם־\rb* \rb a freewill offering|הַ֨נְּדָבָ֔ה\rb* \rb for the house|לְבֵ֥ית\rb* \rb of God|הָאֱלֹהִ֖ים\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb in Jerusalem|בִּירוּשָׁלִָֽם׃\rb*.’”
\p \v 5 \rb So the family|הָאָב֗וֹת\rb* \rb heads|רָאשֵׁ֣י\rb* \rb of Judah|לִֽיהוּדָה֙\rb* \rb and Benjamin|וּבִנְיָמִ֔ן\rb*, \rb along with the priests|וְהַכֹּהֲנִ֖ים\rb* \rb and Levites|וְהַלְוִיִּ֑ם\rb*— \rb everyone|לְכֹ֨ל\rb* \rb whose spirit|רוּח֔וֹ\rb* \rb God|הָאֱלֹהִים֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb had stirred|הֵעִ֤יר\rb*— \rb prepared|וַיָּק֜וּמוּ\rb* \rb to go up|לַעֲל֣וֹת\rb* \rb and rebuild|לִבְנ֔וֹת\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the house|בֵּ֥ית\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb in Jerusalem|בִּירוּשָׁלִָֽם׃\rb*.
\p \v 6 \rb And all|וְכָל־\rb* \rb their neighbors|סְבִיבֹֽתֵיהֶם֙\rb* \rb supported|חִזְּק֣וּ\rb* \rb them|בִֽידֵיהֶ֔ם\rb* \rb with articles|בִּכְלֵי־\rb* \rb of silver|כֶ֧סֶף\rb* \rb and gold|בַּזָּהָ֛ב\rb*, \rb with goods|בָּרְכ֥וּשׁ\rb* \rb and livestock|וּבַבְּהֵמָ֖ה\rb*, \rb and with valuables|וּבַמִּגְדָּנ֑וֹת\rb*, \rb in addition|לְבַ֖ד\rb* \rb to|עַל־\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb their freewill offerings|הִתְנַדֵּֽב׃ס\rb*.
\s1 Cyrus Restores the Holy Vessels
\p \v 7 \rb King|וְהַמֶּ֣לֶךְ\rb* \rb Cyrus|כּ֔וֹרֶשׁ\rb* \rb also brought out|הוֹצִ֖יא\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the articles|כְּלֵ֣י\rb* \rb belonging to the house|בֵית־\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֑ה\rb* \rb that|אֲשֶׁ֨ר\rb* \rb Nebuchadnezzar|נְבֽוּכַדְנֶצַּר֙\rb* \rb had carried away|הוֹצִ֤יא\rb* \rb from Jerusalem|מִיר֣וּשָׁלִַ֔ם\rb* \rb and placed|וַֽיִּתְּנֵ֖ם\rb* \rb in the temple|בְּבֵ֥ית\rb* \rb of his gods|אֱלֹהָֽיו׃\rb*. \v 8 \rb Cyrus|כּ֚וֹרֶשׁ\rb* \rb king|מֶ֣לֶךְ\rb* \rb of Persia|פָּרַ֔ס\rb* \rb had them brought out|וַיּֽוֹצִיאֵ֗ם\rb* \rb by|עַל־\rb* \rb the hand|יַ֖ד\rb* \rb of Mithredath|מִתְרְדָ֣ת\rb* \rb the treasurer|הַגִּזְבָּ֑ר\rb*, \rb who counted them out|וַֽיִּסְפְּרֵם֙\rb* \rb to Sheshbazzar|לְשֵׁשְׁבַּצַּ֔ר\rb* \rb the prince|הַנָּשִׂ֖יא\rb* \rb of Judah|לִיהוּדָֽה׃\rb*.\f + \fr 1:8 \ft That is, the leader of the exiles returning to Judah\f* \v 9 \rb This|וְאֵ֖לֶּה\rb* \rb was the inventory|מִסְפָּרָ֑ם\rb*:
\b 
\li1 \rb 30|שְׁלֹשִׁ֗ים\rb* \rb gold|זָהָ֜ב\rb* \rb dishes|אֲגַרְטְלֵ֨י\rb*,\f + \fr 1:9 \ft Or \fqa basins\ft ; twice in this verse\f*
\li1 \rb 1,000|אָ֔לֶף\rb* \rb silver|כֶ֙סֶף֙\rb* \rb dishes|אֲגַרְטְלֵי־\rb*,
\li1 \rb 29|תִּשְׁעָ֥ה\rb*\rb |וְעֶשְׂרִֽים׃ס\rb* \rb silver utensils|מַחֲלָפִ֖ים\rb*,
\li1 \v 10 \rb 30|שְׁלֹשִׁ֔ים\rb* \rb gold|זָהָב֙\rb* \rb bowls|כְּפוֹרֵ֤י\rb*,
\li1 \rb 410|אַרְבַּ֥ע\rb*\rb |מֵא֖וֹת\rb*\rb |וַעֲשָׂרָ֑ה\rb* \rb matching|מִשְׁנִ֔ים\rb* \rb silver|כֶ֙סֶף֙\rb* \rb bowls|כְּפ֤וֹרֵי\rb*,
\li1 \rb and 1,000|אָֽלֶף׃ס\rb* \rb other|אֲחֵרִ֖ים\rb* \rb articles|כֵּלִ֥ים\rb*.
\p \v 11 \rb In all, there were|כָּל־\rb* \rb 5,400|חֲמֵ֥שֶׁת\rb*\rb |אֲלָפִ֖ים\rb*\rb |וְאַרְבַּ֣ע\rb*\rb |מֵא֑וֹת\rb* \rb gold|לַזָּהָ֣ב\rb* \rb and silver|וְלַכֶּ֔סֶף\rb* \rb articles|כֵּלִים֙\rb*. \rb Sheshbazzar|שֵׁשְׁבַּצַּ֗ר\rb* \rb brought|הֶעֱלָ֣ה\rb* \rb all these|הַכֹּ֞ל\rb* \rb along|עִ֚ם\rb* \rb when the exiles|הַגּוֹלָ֔ה\rb* \rb went up|הֵעָל֣וֹת\rb* \rb from Babylon|מִבָּבֶ֖ל\rb* \rb to Jerusalem|לִירוּשָׁלִָֽם׃פ\rb*.
\c 2
\s1 The List of Returning Exiles
\p \v 1 \rb Now these are|וְאֵ֣לֶּה׀\rb* \rb the people|בְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb of the province|הַמְּדִינָ֗ה\rb* \rb who came up|הָֽעֹלִים֙\rb* \rb from the captivity|מִשְּׁבִ֣י\rb* \rb of the exiles|הַגּוֹלָ֔ה\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb carried away|הֶגְלָ֛ה\rb* \rb to Babylon|לְבָבֶ֑ל\rb* \rb by Nebuchadnezzar|נְבוּכַדְנֶצּוֹר\rb* \rb its king|מֶֽלֶךְ־\rb*\rb |בָּבֶ֖ל\rb*. \rb They returned|וַיָּשׁ֛וּבוּ\rb* \rb to Jerusalem|לִירוּשָׁלִַ֥ם\rb* \rb and Judah|וִֽיהוּדָ֖ה\rb*, \rb each|אִ֥ישׁ\rb* \rb to his own town|לְעִירֽוֹ׃\rb*, \v 2 \rb |אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb accompanied|בָּ֣אוּ\rb* \rb by|עִם־\rb* \rb Zerubbabel|זְרֻבָּבֶ֗ל\rb*, \rb Jeshua|יֵשׁ֡וּעַ\rb*, \rb Nehemiah|נְ֠חֶמְיָה\rb*, \rb Seraiah|שְׂרָיָ֨ה\rb*, \rb Reelaiah|רְֽעֵלָיָ֜ה\rb*, \rb Mordecai|מָרְדֳּכַ֥י\rb*, \rb Bilshan|בִּלְשָׁ֛ן\rb*, \rb Mispar|מִסְפָּ֥ר\rb*, \rb Bigvai|בִּגְוַ֖י\rb*, \rb Rehum|רְח֣וּם\rb*, \rb and Baanah|בַּעֲנָ֑ה\rb*.\f + \fr 2:2 \ft Parallel text at Nehemiah 7:7 \fqa accompanied by Zerubbabel, Jeshua, Nehemiah, Azariah, Raamiah, Nahamani, Mordecai, Bilshan, Mispereth, Bigvai, Nehum, and Baanah\f*
\p \rb This is the count|מִסְפַּ֕ר\rb* \rb of the men|אַנְשֵׁ֖י\rb*\rb |עַ֥ם\rb* \rb of Israel|יִשְׂרָאֵֽל׃ס\rb*:
\b 
\li1 \v 3 \rb the descendants|בְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Parosh|פַרְעֹ֔שׁ\rb*, \rb 2,172|אַלְפַּ֕יִם\rb*\rb |מֵאָ֖ה\rb*\rb |שִׁבְעִ֥ים\rb*\rb |וּשְׁנָֽיִם׃ס\rb*;
\li1 \v 4 \rb the descendants|בְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Shephatiah|שְׁפַטְיָ֔ה\rb*, \rb 372|שְׁלֹ֥שׁ\rb*\rb |מֵא֖וֹת\rb*\rb |שִׁבְעִ֥ים\rb*\rb |וּשְׁנָֽיִם׃ס\rb*;
\li1 \v 5 \rb the descendants|בְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Arah|אָרַ֔ח\rb*, \rb 775|שְׁבַ֥ע\rb*\rb |מֵא֖וֹת\rb*\rb |חֲמִשָּׁ֥ה\rb*\rb |וְשִׁבְעִֽים׃ס\rb*;
\li1 \v 6 \rb the descendants|בְּנֵֽי־\rb*\rb |פַחַ֥ת\rb* \rb of Pahath-moab|מוֹאָ֛ב\rb* (\rb through the line|לִבְנֵ֥י\rb* \rb of Jeshua|יֵשׁ֖וּעַ\rb* \rb and Joab|יוֹאָ֑ב\rb*), \rb 2,812|אַלְפַּ֕יִם\rb*\rb |שְׁמֹנֶ֥ה\rb*\rb |מֵא֖וֹת\rb*\rb |וּשְׁנֵ֥ים\rb*\rb |עָשָֽׂר׃ס\rb*;
\li1 \v 7 \rb the descendants|בְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Elam|עֵילָ֔ם\rb*, \rb 1,254|אֶ֕לֶף\rb*\rb |מָאתַ֖יִם\rb*\rb |חֲמִשִּׁ֥ים\rb*\rb |וְאַרְבָּעָֽה׃ס\rb*;
\li1 \v 8 \rb the descendants|בְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Zattu|זַתּ֔וּא\rb*, \rb 945|תְּשַׁ֥ע\rb*\rb |מֵא֖וֹת\rb*\rb |וְאַרְבָּעִ֥ים\rb*\rb |וַחֲמִשָּֽׁה׃ס\rb*;
\li1 \v 9 \rb the descendants|בְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Zaccai|זַכָּ֔י\rb*, \rb 760|שְׁבַ֥ע\rb*\rb |מֵא֖וֹת\rb*\rb |וְשִׁשִּֽׁים׃ס\rb*;
\li1 \v 10 \rb the descendants|בְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Bani|בָנִ֔י\rb*,\f + \fr 2:10 \fqa Bani \ft is a variant of \fqa Binnui\ft ; see Nehemiah 7:15.\f* \rb 642|שֵׁ֥שׁ\rb*\rb |מֵא֖וֹת\rb*\rb |אַרְבָּעִ֥ים\rb*\rb |וּשְׁנָֽיִם׃ס\rb*;
\li1 \v 11 \rb the descendants|בְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Bebai|בֵבָ֔י\rb*, \rb 623|שֵׁ֥שׁ\rb*\rb |מֵא֖וֹת\rb*\rb |עֶשְׂרִ֥ים\rb*\rb |וּשְׁלֹשָֽׁה׃ס\rb*;
\li1 \v 12 \rb the descendants|בְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Azgad|עַזְגָּ֔ד\rb*, \rb 1,222|אֶ֕לֶף\rb*\rb |מָאתַ֖יִם\rb*\rb |עֶשְׂרִ֥ים\rb*\rb |וּשְׁנָֽיִם׃ס\rb*;
\li1 \v 13 \rb the descendants|בְּנֵי֙\rb* \rb of Adonikam|אֲדֹ֣נִיקָ֔ם\rb*, \rb 666|שֵׁ֥שׁ\rb*\rb |מֵא֖וֹת\rb*\rb |שִׁשִּׁ֥ים\rb*\rb |וְשִׁשָּֽׁה׃ס\rb*;
\li1 \v 14 \rb the descendants|בְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Bigvai|בִגְוָ֔י\rb*, \rb 2,056|אַלְפַּ֖יִם\rb*\rb |חֲמִשִּׁ֥ים\rb*\rb |וְשִׁשָּֽׁה׃ס\rb*;
\li1 \v 15 \rb the descendants|בְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Adin|עָדִ֔ין\rb*, \rb 454|אַרְבַּ֥ע\rb*\rb |מֵא֖וֹת\rb*\rb |חֲמִשִּׁ֥ים\rb*\rb |וְאַרְבָּעָֽה׃ס\rb*;
\li1 \v 16 \rb the descendants|בְּנֵֽי־\rb* \rb of Ater|אָטֵ֥ר\rb* (\rb through Hezekiah|לִֽיחִזְקִיָּ֖ה\rb*), \rb 98|תִּשְׁעִ֥ים\rb*\rb |וּשְׁמֹנָֽה׃ס\rb*;
\li1 \v 17 \rb the descendants|בְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Bezai|בֵצָ֔י\rb*, \rb 323|שְׁלֹ֥שׁ\rb*\rb |מֵא֖וֹת\rb*\rb |עֶשְׂרִ֥ים\rb*\rb |וּשְׁלֹשָֽׁה׃ס\rb*;
\li1 \v 18 \rb the descendants|בְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Jorah|יוֹרָ֔ה\rb*,\f + \fr 2:18 \fqa Jorah \ft is a variant of \fqa Hariph\ft ; see Nehemiah 7:24.\f* \rb 112|מֵאָ֖ה\rb*\rb |וּשְׁנֵ֥ים\rb*\rb |עָשָֽׂר׃ס\rb*;
\li1 \v 19 \rb the descendants|בְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Hashum|חָשֻׁ֔ם\rb*, \rb 223|מָאתַ֖יִם\rb*\rb |עֶשְׂרִ֥ים\rb*\rb |וּשְׁלֹשָֽׁה׃ס\rb*;
\li1 \v 20 \rb the descendants|בְּנֵ֥י\rb* \rb of Gibbar|גִבָּ֖ר\rb*,\f + \fr 2:20 \fqa Gibbar \ft is a variant of \fqa Gibeon\ft ; see Nehemiah 7:25.\f* \rb 95|תִּשְׁעִ֥ים\rb*\rb |וַחֲמִשָּֽׁה׃ס\rb*;
\li1 \v 21 \rb the men|בְּנֵ֣י\rb*\f + \fr 2:21 \ft Literally \fqa the sons\ft ; here and in verses 25, 26, 33, and 34\f*\rb |בֵֽית־\rb* \rb of Bethlehem|לָ֔חֶם\rb*, \rb 123|מֵאָ֖ה\rb*\rb |עֶשְׂרִ֥ים\rb*\rb |וּשְׁלֹשָֽׁה׃ס\rb*;
\li1 \v 22 \rb the men|אַנְשֵׁ֥י\rb* \rb of Netophah|נְטֹפָ֖ה\rb*, \rb 56|חֲמִשִּׁ֥ים\rb*\rb |וְשִׁשָּֽׁה׃\rb*;
